# Build context hygiene for the runtime image (Dockerfile copies one binary)
# and for the source build in api/Dockerfile, whose context is the repo root.
.git
.env
*.zip
.playwright-cli/
node_modules/
# pnpm installs into ui/node_modules: never send it (or a host-built bundle)
# into any image context — api/Dockerfile installs and builds inside the image.
**/node_modules
ui/dist
communication-spec/
communication-ui-brief/
COMMUNICATION_MASTER_SPEC.md
docs/
# .release-assets/ is deliberately NOT ignored: worker/Dockerfile's executionbin
# stage COPYs it from the build context as the offline cache for the nono/apm/gh
# release downloads (scripts/fetch-release-assets.sh populates it; every file is
# sha256-verified against the Dockerfile pin before use).
